    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n26946" root="طلع" body-key="T">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">طَلِعٌ</span></b>  (tropical:)  [<i>Desirous, eager,</i> or <i>vehemently eager</i>].
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نَفْسٌ طَلِعَةٌ</span> and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نُفُوسٌ طَلِعَةٌ</span>, like <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">فَرِحَةٌ</span> [in form],
mean (tropical:)  <i>A soul,</i> and <i>souls, desirous, eager,</i> or <i>vehemently eager.</i> (TA.) [See also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">طُلَعَةٌ</span>.]

